| 6 | Wrap route logic in try/catch or use async/await with a promise error handler |
| 7 | Validate query parameters (if any) with a library (Joi, celebrate, etc.) |
| 8 | Add logging (morgan) and optional external log aggregator |
| 9 | Proper server event listeners (`error`, `SIGINT`) |
|10 | Use `const`/`let` consistently & keep a naming convention |

